              "id": "f1f1fe0e-3b75-4f82-b27d-f65b033194cb",
              "name": "prompt",
              "value": "=Create a visually striking yet simple and sober thumbnail that represents the essence and celebration of {{ $json.Event }}. The image should primarily focus on the event itself, expressing energy, emotion, and realism, while subtly incorporating inspiration from {{ $json.products[0].description }} and {{ $json.products[0].theme }} in a minimal and elegant way. Do not make the product the main focus; the event must remain the center of attention.\n\nThe design should include only one text element: {{ $json.output }}. This text must appear visually attractive, clean, professionally styled, and ready for posting on social media. No additional text is allowed, and there should be no spelling mistakes. Do not use any company logos or branding symbols.\n\nThe image must look fully realistic, like a professional human-shot photograph. If people appear, they should look natural with correct anatomy, realistic expressions, and genuine interaction. Avoid anything that suggests AI generation—no distorted fingers, no plastic skin, no unnatural lighting, no surreal backgrounds, no extra limbs, and no overly smooth or artificial textures. Lighting, reflections, color grading, and depth should resemble real-life professional photography.\n\nMaintain a balanced, modern, and impactful visual style that aligns with LinkedIn aesthetics—dynamic yet clean, visually engaging but not cluttered, emotional yet elegant. The overall composition should feel authentic, polished, and respectful to the nature of the event celebration while gracefully reflecting a touch of the product identity without distraction.\n\n",
              "type": "string"
            }
